note bottom of p_midi
  Landed 2026-09-25 as BLOCK 3 of the firmware-protocols work. The cell is
  built from COUNTED INSTRUCTIONS, not the shared tick: a 32 us bit is 7.38
  ticks and 4.3333 us cannot express a fraction, so midi_xfer.pe uses the
  timer zero times. Measured on the pin: 31,998.7 ns = 31,251 baud with a
  spread of 0.0000 us over all 14 frames. Its receiver is a free-running
  oversampling search that VERIFIES each frame's stop bit, because in a
  back-to-back 8N1 stream a falling edge is not a start bit.
  Evidence: reviews/2026-09-25/FW-BUS-BLOCK3-FINDINGS.md.
end note

note bottom of p_dmx
  Landed 2026-09-25, the mirror image: a 4 us bit is 0.923 of a tick, so
  DMX is the rate the tick cannot express AT ALL. Break 88.06 us (floor
  87.5), mark 12.38 us (floor 8.0), 513/513 slots with BOTH stop bits
  verified, cell 3,999.8 ns = 250,010 baud, spread 0.0000 us over 513 slots.
  The frame is 22.6 ms of simulated time (1.37M clocks), so the receiver
  samples only inside a slot rather than free-running a strobe across it.
  Evidence: reviews/2026-09-25/FW-BUS-BLOCK3-FINDINGS.md.
end note

note bottom of r3_ctr
  STATUS CORRECTION, and it is the one worth reading on this diagram. The
  R3 debug-control contract is FROZEN (manager ruling 2026-09-25, "draft-for-
  implementation") and the golden-vector package shape exists, but the RTL
  does NOT: pe_ctrl.v and pe_cpu.v contain no bp_ or step signal at all, only
  comments about what a debugger would need. So this section is AMBER/RED on
  purpose. Drawing it green would be the exact class of error this block's own
  findings file keeps documenting -- a confident claim nothing checked.
  The two levers that will actually move it: the bp comparator and the debug
  response mux, and the STOP-BEFORE semantics that make a breakpoint land
  before the matched instruction rather than after it.
end note

note bottom of fv_mut
  Non-vacuity, which is the reason the gate exists: a proof that does not kill
  its mutant is not a proof. formal/mutants.sh reports 10 caught / 0 survived,
  and one eth_tx reachability claim is labelled VACUOUS at the gate depth
  rather than quietly reported as a proof. 9 properties, not 11 -- the summary
  file is the authority.
end note

